#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# STM32F1 Series Chip Variant Selection
#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This file defines chip variants for STM32F1 series.
# TODO: Add specific chip variants (F100, F101, F102, F103, F105, F107)
